{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Livestream Legend!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Content King</i>, you live as Caden Brentley, a young brainrot streamer who broadcasts his entire life. Pursue clout by any means necessary to become the biggest streamer of all time. Complete quests, start drama with streamers, and farm clips to boost your view count and climb the ranks of internet fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/d1a6524982c2e745badb13faf4ae9ff1.poster.avif?t=1773937395\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/d1a6524982c2e745badb13faf4ae9ff1.webm?t=1773937395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/d1a6524982c2e745badb13faf4ae9ff1.mp4?t=1773937395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interact with Everybody!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless characters voiced by real streamers, every interaction brings new drama, new dialogue, and new choices. Will you help them\u2026 or simply use them for content?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/6c20c50dc6cdca5344f9da38847cf839.poster.avif?t=1773937395\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/6c20c50dc6cdca5344f9da38847cf839.webm?t=1773937395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/6c20c50dc6cdca5344f9da38847cf839.mp4?t=1773937395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_